Description: Personal finances from Open Finance (Meu Pluggy): KDE app and Plasma widget
 Saldo shows bank balances, credit card limits, card bills, investments and
 transactions from Open Finance Brasil, through the free Meu Pluggy
 personal-use API, as a Kirigami app and a Plasma 6 widget. Brazilian banks
 only. Credentials stay in the system keyring and data is cached locally.
